p Dear #{@user.decorate.full_name},
p The following reports have been approved.

p Project: #{@project.name}
p Campaign: #{@campaign.name}
p Report: #{@report.name}
p Count of reports: #{@reports.size}

p You are receiving this email as you have been added as the contact to receive report approval notification for the reports.

p You can access the report via the following link:

= link_to 'Reports', @url
